+      (Set.range (fun i => algebraMap (MvPolynomial τ K ⧸ I) F
+        ((Ideal.Quotient.mk I) (a i)))) = ⊤) :
+    ∃ c : MvPolynomial τ K ⧸ I, c ≠ 0 ∧ ∀ x, ∃ p, projectionCoordinateMap I a p = c * x := by
